    "title": "Lamp Lighting ceremony, 2010 at Aga Khan University",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Close to 100 second-year nursing students from the Diploma in Nursing and BScN programmes at Aga Khan University School of Nursing took this International Pledge, holding a lighted lamp.",
